cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bun_nltk, cite this software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "bun_nltk: broad NLTK API coverage in TypeScript with Rust/WASM acceleration and local multi-platform builds"
type: software
version: 0.16.0
date-released: 2026-08-27
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - given-names: "Touhidul Alam"
    family-names: "Seyam"
    affiliation: "BGC Trust University Bangladesh"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-7512-1893"
abstract: >-
  bun_nltk is a TypeScript NLP toolkit with import coverage for 241 names in a
  frozen NLTK API index. It includes selected Rust native and WebAssembly paths,
  432 tests, and a separate 37-group differential fidelity gate.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Seyamalam/bun_nltk"
url: "https://www.npmjs.com/package/bun_nltk"
keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - NLTK
  - TypeScript
  - Rust
  - WebAssembly
  - Bun
